e 20 minute mark! Yes it's true! Practice, practice, practice! Thanks for your time.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/4complete.jpg">   <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
